	(text "Can we use all pins also using I2C?\nIf yes, remove all\nAnd what happens with them if we do not use it?\n\nEN_BUCKn in Registers can Enable BUCKn without EN1/2\nReset can be software commanded from Reg 0x16\n\nnRST Low = shutdown. nRST High = startup.\nPull up nRST.\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 62.23 196.342 0)
